<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Exam Application System</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }

    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: white;
      padding: 10px 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .navbar .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      color: green;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .navbar ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .navbar ul li a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #333;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 5px 10px;
    }

    .navbar ul li a:hover,
    .navbar ul li a.active {
      color: white;
      background-color: green;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }

    .about-section {
      background-color: #e3f9e5;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-section h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .about-section h4 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #555;
    }

    .about-content {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 40px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .about-content img {
      max-width: 250px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .about-content .text {
      max-width: 600px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .about-content .text p {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .about-content .text button {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: green;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .team-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .team-section h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .team-cards {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .card {
      background-color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      width: 260px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: gray;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .card button {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: green;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    footer {
      background-color: #333;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .about-content {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .about-content .text {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .navbar ul {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="logo">ExamApp</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#" class="active">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#team">Team</a></li>
      <li><a href="/adminlogin">Login</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <section class="about-section" id="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <h4>ExamApp is a smart exam management platform...</h4>
    <div class="about-content">
      <img src="/images/examappsys.jpeg" alt="Exam Logo">
      <div class="text">
        <p>ExamApp is a powerful exam platform built for students, educators, and institutions to easily manage online exams. With a clean interface and smart features, it's easy to schedule, take, and review exams.</p>
        <p>Built with performance in mind, it supports thousands of users with features like real-time results, question banks, and role-based dashboards.</p>
        <button onclick="window.location.href='/adminlogin'">Read More..</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="team-section" id="team">
    <h2>Meet Our Team</h2>
    <div class="team-cards">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="/images/sakshi.jpg" alt="Jane">
        <h3>Sakshi Patkotwar</h3>
        <p>Admin<br>sakshipatkotwar@.com</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="/images/siddhi.jpg" alt="Miller">
        <h3>Siddhi Shinde</h3>
        <p>Admin<br>siddhishinde.com</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 ExamApp. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
